    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d314-a22">

                <pb facs="0751" n="667" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg667"/>

                <p>Under the same date it is stated regarding Lorenzo Torres and Mrs. Durazo do
                    Langstone that this court has information that said persons are not at present
                    within the district, for which reason their affidavits cannot be taken.</p>
                <closer><signed>MONGE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
